{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[A]The master went away on a jour[D]ney
[F#m]He gave his servants what he [D]had [E]
[A]Five to one and two to an[D]other
One to the [F#m]last, and he wasn't [D]glad [E]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[A]The first one traded and he dou[D]bled it
[F#m]The second one did the [D]same [E]
